  "description": "The Lost Mary BM600 Prefilled Pod Kit brings the iconic BM600 disposable vape experience into a rechargeable, prefilled pod kit format. This revamped Lost Mary BM600 pod kit retains the same super-compact, 'matchbox-style' form factor; crisp, satisfying draw; chic, colourful designs and vibrant flavours that made the original Lost Mary BM600 such a bestseller, but now adds the all the cost-saving benefits of a rechargeable battery and replaceable pods. This kit comes preloaded with a 2ml pod of 20mg nicotine salt e-liquid, delivering rapid nicotine relief and a smooth, satisfying mouth-to-lung (MTL) vape with up to 600 puffs per pod. With inhale activation and no buttons or settings to adjust, the Lost Mary BM600 Prefilled Pod Kit offers a truly effortless vaping experience. The built-in rechargeable battery ensures continuous use, with a USB-C charging port for quick and easy recharging, while a handy Status Indicator Light, located next to the charging port, offers at-a-glance information on your battery status. Ideal for new and experienced vapers alike, the Lost Mary BM600 Prefilled Pod Kit is a super-compact, easy-to-use solution for those who want a consistent and flavourful vape without the waste and expense of single-use disposables. Lost Mary BM600 Prefilled Kit Flavours • Blueberry • Blue Razz Ice • Blueberry Sour Raspberry • Cherry Ice • Double Apple • Grape • Lemon Lime • Menthol • Peach Ice • Pineapple Ice • Pink Lemonadee • Strawberry Ice • Strawberry Kiwi • Triple Mango • Triple Melon • Watermelon Ice How to Use: 1. Remove the Silicon Plug from the top of the pod. 2. Peel off the sticker on the bottom of the device Please Note: USB-C Cable Sold Separately How to set up the Lost Mary BM600 Prefilled Pod Vape Kit Shop Lost Mary BM600 Refill Pods",
